{"meta":{"format_version":"4.5","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"armour_minotaur_dread","model_identifier":"armour_minotaur_dread","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## armour_minotaur_dread\n\nArmour for the Dreadnought, the minotaur's bracers and pauldron, sized for him (Patch 7). Worn by `heavy_knight_body` over his harness (`armour_dreadnought_harness`).\n\n- Cubes: 10. Texture 64x64, 1 texel per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -27.0..23.5, y 35.0..74.0, z -8.0..8.0 (50.5 x 39 x 16 units = 142 x 110 x 45 cm).\n- Source: `minotaur` (unchanged): `gear_pauldron` (pauldron_top, pauldron_lame_1, pauldron_lame_2, pauldron_spike, pauldron_spike_tip, pauldron_strap), `gear_bracer_l` and `gear_bracer_r` (bracer and outer plate each). Redrawn at the Dreadnought's size: each face is the minotaur's own face resampled (nearest) from its 2 texels per unit to 1 texel per unit at the new size, so the iron and leather keep the minotaur's colours and pixel style.\n- Pieces, in heavy_knight_body's bones (same names and rest origins):\n  - `pauldron_l` (-18, 60, 0), left shoulder as on the minotaur: `pauldron_top` x -23..-10, y 64..67 over the cap of his scale pauldron; `pauldron_lame_1` (x -26..-24, y 61..65) and `pauldron_lame_2` (x -27..-25, y 58..61) stepping down the outside, outside the harness's second and outer tiers; `pauldron_spike` and `pauldron_spike_tip` on top (to y 74); `pauldron_strap` on the inner edge. They ride on the pauldron's cap bone, so they follow the harness pauldron in every clip; the front and back of the harness's tiers and its lame stay visible.\n  - `arm_lower_r` (18, 46, 0) and `arm_lower_l` (-18, 46, 0): `bracer_r` / `bracer_l` x 13.5..22.5 (mirrored), y 35..43, z -5..5 round each forearm over his leather bracer, with the riveted plate on the outside (`bracer_r_plate`, `bracer_l_plate`). The harness has no arm plates, so the bracers sit on the body's forearm.\n- No clips of its own; the body's clips move it. In the two-handed poses the mace haft passes close under the left wrist, as on heavy_knight (it already grazes his leather bracer by 1 to 3 units in some poses); the bracer starts 2 units further up the forearm than his leather bracer but is 1 unit wider, so similar small contacts can show there.\n"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"pauldron_top","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-23,64,-8],"to":[-10,67,8],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[-18,60,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16,39,29,42],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[36,34,52,37],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[29,39,42,42],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,39,16,42],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,13,16],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[13,0,26,16],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"fd3c0e68-da18-5e6b-b31c-b371a3a02d01"},{"name":"pauldron_lame_1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-26,61,-7],"to":[-24,65,7],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[-18,60,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[32,34,34,38],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[4,34,18,38],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[34,34,36,38],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[18,34,32,38],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[26,0,28,14],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[28,0,30,14],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"9b0f7766-e239-571d-b08f-41477bf009c9"},{"name":"pauldron_lame_2","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-27,58,-6],"to":[-25,61,6],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[-18,60,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[12,42,14,45],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[42,39,54,42],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[14,42,16,45],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,42,12,45],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[30,0,32,12],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[32,0,34,12],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"08462b7c-72ee-5a40-a1a0-7e057cc88c1e"},{"name":"pauldron_spike","box_uv":fa