loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"dc4c1082-3ae1-5f89-832b-6dcb2a64fa3d","relative_path":"","mode":"bitmap","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[],"description":"## armour_minotaur_dread\n\nArmour, worn by the Dreadnought over his harness (Patch 7 loot).\n\n- Cubes: 10 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -27.0..23.5, y 35.0..74.0, z -8.0..8.0 (size 50.5 x 39.0 x 16.0 u = 142 x 110 x 45 cm).\nThe minotaur's bracers and pauldron (`minotaur.bbmodel`: `gear_bracer_l`, `gear_bracer_r`, `gear_pauldron`), sized for the Dreadnought and worn over `armour_dreadnought_harness`: the layered, spiked pauldron with its lames and strap on `pauldron_l`, and a bracer with its plate on each forearm (`arm_lower_r/l`). Patch 7 loot.\n"}